silm:instances_papers_04_forge_chapters_06_dependency_governance_sections_03_dependency_and_mittens_legs_concrete_anchor_2#mittensmeasurementshapegate silm:hasLongDescription "The MittensMeasurementShapeGate is In section 'Dependencies and \\(\\Mittens\\) Source Legs' the bare symbol TaxLeg anchors to MittensMeasurementShapeGate: The SHACL shape constraint node that any measurement-leg input must satisfy: required fields are cited_source, value, date, observer; a failed input is rejected before publication." .
